<title>CANADA: Bank of Canada excess settlement balances.</title>
<headline>Bank of Canada excess settlement balances.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Canada's computed cumulative excess settlement balances for the period October 17 to October 30 was C$505 million, the Bank said.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
